{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100896","id":2254558784,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6GYdZA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100896","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100896.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100896.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100896","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100896/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100896/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100896/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a037bafccf6d1b46083b5874c192c565c59cacd7","number":100896,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Support editing scenes of any large physical size","user":{"login":"Flarkk","id":49606622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NjA2NjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49606622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk","html_url":"https://github.com/Flarkk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Follow-up of #99986.\r\n*Note : This PR is ready for review, but kept in Draft state on purpose until dependencies get resolved.*\r\n\r\n### Outline\r\n**This PR enables rendering and editing arbitrary large scenes and objects in the Editor**.\r\n\r\nThis is especially useful for open worlds, space scenes and alike.\r\n\r\nThis is achieved by raising the maximum allowed far (and near) distance in the editor's View settings, and fixing a handful of numerical precision issues :\r\n- Move computations happening in world space to view space for :\r\n  - Gizmo positionning\r\n  - Gizmo handles picking\r\n  - Objects picking\r\n- Fix box select of very far away objects\r\n- Fix orthogonal camera positionning with very large zfar\r\n\r\n### Dependencies\r\n- #99986 (enables large zfar rendering)\r\n- #100511 (remove numerical precision issues on raycast functions)\r\n- #100478 (remove numerical precision issue on gizmo picking)\r\n- #100718 (enables view space raycasting)\r\n\r\n### Demo\r\n[large_zfar_editor.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18269271/large_zfar_editor.zip)\r\n\r\nVegetation is ~1m tall and ~10m from the origin\r\nThe terrain is 10 km large\r\nThe earth's radius is 6,000 km\r\nThe moon's radius is 1,700 km and is 400,000 km from the origin\r\nThe sun's radius is 700,000 km and is 150 million km from the origin\r\nThe Andromeda galaxy is 152,000 light-years wide and is 2.5 million light years from the observer\r\n\r\n[output.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/319b49c5-d737-48f0-af93-1e4b74f2dfac)\r\n\r\n- *Bugsquad edit: This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15086.*","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"arc